Backport the W-reader batching from tenstorrent/tt-metal#53564:
https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/pull/53564
Use a compile define on the pinned API so other shared-reader callers stay unbatched.

diff --git ttnn/cpp/ttnn/operations/reduction/generic/device/reduce_op_multi_core_w_program_factory.cpp ttnn/cpp/ttnn/operations/reduction/generic/device/reduce_op_multi_core_w_program_factory.cpp
